<title>SINGAPORE: Nepal issues tender to buy diesel for June 1-10.</title>
<headline>Nepal issues tender to buy diesel for June 1-10.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Nepal Oil Corp (NOC) has issued a tender to buy 30,000 tonnes of high speed diesel or 1.0-percent sulphur gas oil for June 1-10 delivery to the Indian east coast on a cost-and-freight (c-and-f) basis, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The tender closes on May 6 and offers will be valid for two days.</p>
<p>In its last tender, Nepal bought 30,000 tonnes of gas oil from Swiss trader Glencore at $194 per tonne for May 1-10 delivery, on a two-port discharge basis to the Indian east coast, c-and-f.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3084)</p>
